    "body": "Reopened (user-reported project, AGENTS.md: reopen, never re-file). The fix (PR #1772, merged 2026-11-15) is in the v0.21.0 release tree (release/v0.21.0 at 0c477509). The user's own project still refuses with that tree: `camcraft-cli process sc_logo.camproj` exits 1: \"post blocked - setup 'Setup 2': fixture 'Soft jaw (8)' stands inside the stock carried from setup 'Setup 1' (9.93 mm deep) - the part that setup leaves cannot be held as modelled\". The same refusal and depth as before the fix. The pins in #1772 cover an open-sided notch, but the operation in this project still leaves the material where jaw 8 sits. Next: compare this project's Setup 1 3D Pocket (region, boundary, open-side detection) with the pin fixture and find why the open side is not found here. (The separate soft-jaw project, sc_logo_softjaws.camproj, posts clean with the same tree.)",
