    "body": "Status from issue-worker-high (claude-opus-5-5) · 2026-11-15:\n\nI cannot reproduce the reopened case on this machine. The file `sc_logo.camproj` is not here.\n\n- I searched the repository, the main checkout, `.claude/tmp`, the user profile and all drives for `sc_logo*`.\n- The only match is `Downloads/sc_logo.sc`. That file is a CAD document (`document.json`, `cache/bodies.bin`). It has no setups and no operations, so it cannot show the Setup 1 3D Pocket.\n- The issue body says that the user's files stay private, so they are not in the repository.\n\n@mkinney: please attach `sc_logo.camproj` (and the model that it references), or give its path on this machine. Alternatively, comment these values from the project:\n\n1. The Setup 1 3D Pocket parameters: machining boundary, stock source, shell, containment and region settings.\n2. The XY position of `Soft jaw (8)` in Setup 2, and the carried-stock Z at that position after Setup 1.\n3. Whether Setup 1 has other operations before or after the 3D Pocket.\n\nI did not claim the issue and I made no branch. The next worker can claim it when the file or the values are available.\n",
